description: Shared contract for Tehdejší svět — scope, scoring, privacy, Czech voice
alwaysApply: true
---

All assistants in this repository follow one shared contract: `AGENTS.md` at the
repository root. Read it first; tool-specific files only point there so nothing
drifts.

Load-bearing rules:

- The shipped app calls **no model** and fetches **no historical data** at
  runtime. AI runs only at build time and its output is committed JSON.
- The same person must always yield the same report — all randomness goes
  through the seeded PRNG in `src/lib/random.ts`.
- Facts are chosen by **scored editorial relevance**, and **deterministic gates
  (sensitivity, share-safety, age window, CZ/UA scope) always outrank scores.**
  Never invent a rubric: print the real one with
  `npm run relevance:prompt -- A` and follow `docs/fact-scoring.md`.
- Public scope is Czechia and Ukraine only. Form values never leave the browser.
- Czech voice: formal `vy / vás / vaše`, concrete, honest uncertainty, no
  overclaiming. `npm run audit:content` fails the build on forbidden phrasing.
- Anything that renders pixels must be run and looked at, not reviewed by diff.

Verify with `npm run check` from `dontwannaknow/` on Node 22. Commit in Czech.
